catalyst, PEG-stabilized nickel nanoparticles used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Chemoselective N-benzylation of 2-thiohydantoins and 2-thiobarbituric
acids catalyzed by PEG-stabilized Ni nanoparticles and their
anti-microbial activities
